# Anti-slop checks

When changing matching files, follow `.cursor/skills/anti-slop/SKILL.md`.

Prefer MCP tools `ux_lint` / `check_ai_slop` / `grade_landing_copy` when those servers are connected. Fall back to:

- `.tools/venv/bin/uxskill lint src`
- `npx -y impeccable@3.6.0 detect src/`
